        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth cu wee i̱, “Kuanɛ raan cak kɛ cätdan, banɛ jɛ cal ni kɛ cätdan, kä bi rɛc yiëri ruac kɛnɛ diit nhial kɛ ɣɔ̱k kɛ muɔɔl piɛny amäni wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliwdɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth raan cu cak nikɛ cätdɛ pa̱ny, kɛ cät Kuɔth puɔ̱nydɛ cuɛ raan cak nikɛ jɛ. Cuɛ jɛ cak tuut kɛnɛ ŋuɔ̱ɔ̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ poth, jio̱kɛ kɛ i̱, “Ta̱yɛ kɛ gaat kä diëthɛ rɔ̱, kä thia̱ŋɛ wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n kä ruacɛ jɛ, kä ta̱yɛ kɛ ruec kɛ rɛc yiëri kɛnɛ diit nhial amäni le̱y diaal tin jäl wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth cu wee i̱, “Guɛcɛ jɛ, cä yɛ ka̱m wal wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n diaal tin kui̱r kɛ kuay, kɛ jiɛn diaal ti te dɛykiɛn kɛ roŋ, cä kɛ ka̱m yɛ ala mi̱thkun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cä le̱y diaal kɛ diit nhial diaal kɛnɛ muɔɔl piɛny, kɛn diaal tin te wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n, cä kɛ ka̱m juaac diaal tin tɔ̱ɔ̱c ala mi̱thkiɛn.” Kä cuɛ cua̱ jɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ, cu Kuoth nyinkɛ diaal tëë cɛ cak cu guic, cuɛ kɛ nɛn gɔwkɛ ɛpuc. Cuɛ tekɛ thiaŋ kɛnɛ runwaŋ, kä cuɛ cua̱ cäŋ in bäkɛliɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
